WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie face-down, arms alongside the body with the palms facing up.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rest the forehead down and lengthen the tailbone toward the heels.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lift the head, chest, arms, and legs away from the floor.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Reach the fingertips back toward the feet, opening across the collarbones.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the gaze down to protect the neck; hold, then lower slowly.
